    ceilingNote: 'The ceiling depends heavily on whether you own the warehouse floor or the inventory strategy behind it — those are two different careers wearing the same job title.',
  },
  {
    fn: 'Demand planning and forecasting',
    exposure: 'Medium',
    exposureNote: 'Baseline statistical forecasting is genuinely automatable now, and AI-assisted forecasting tools already outperform manual spreadsheet models on routine SKUs.',
