  {
    fn: 'Vendor and supplier relationship management',
    exposure: 'Low',
    exposureNote: 'Renegotiating a contract after a supplier misses quality, reading early risk signals, and holding a relationship together under pressure are not tasks software does today.',
    ceiling: 'High',
    ceilingNote: 'This function usually opens up only after a few years elsewhere, but once you are in it, the ceiling is close to procurement leadership, without procurement\'s heavier automation exposure at entry level.',
  },
